step To the Scarlet Monastery
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Dungeons for five players, each its own wing with its own door in the monastery's courtyard, in Horde land: the Library (levels 33 to 41), the Armory (36 to 44) and the Cathedral (38 to 46).
  enter "Scarlet Monastery" @82.6,33.8

step The Library
  tip Houndmaster Loksey is for Raleigh, Arcanist Doan comes after him, and the books lie about the halls.
  kill 3974 quest 1053.4 @82.6,33.8 group 5
  collect 5536 quest 1050.1 @82.6,33.8 group 5
  collect 7274 quest 1951.1 @82.6,33.8 group 5 only Mage

step The Lost Magic of the Runemasters
  tip The data has Magus Olvek's book come from an object it places nowhere: look for it in the monastery.
  collect 273169 quest 96800.1 @82.6,33.8 group 5

step The Armory
  tip Herod, the Armory's boss, is for Raleigh.
  kill 3975 quest 1053.3 @82.6,33.8 group 5

step The Cathedral
  tip High Inquisitor Fairbanks, Scarlet Commander Mograine and High Inquisitor Whitemane: the last two are for Raleigh.
  kill 3976 quest 1053.2 @82.6,33.8 group 5
  kill 3977 quest 1053.1 @82.6,33.8 group 5

